BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Early GOTV: Defend Our Democracy General Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T114500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T133000
UID:989718a6dc74ef438e2b646540b72539@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/early-gotv-mobilize_20260629132828463932.png
DESCRIPTION:The general election in November is critical for defending our
  democracy from further damage and gaining ground for progressive change. 
 At this meeting\, we’ll share ways to support progressive candidates at 
 the local\, state\, and federal level during the key “Get Out the Vote
 ” (GOTV) period leading up to the election. Meet and greet with three lo
 cal progressive candidates: - Brad Meyer\, candidate for the US House (Ind
 iana District 9) - Amy Huffman Oliver\, candidate for Indiana House Distri
 ct 62 -
LOCATION:Monroe County Library - Ellettsville Branch\, 600 W Temperance St
 \, Ellettsville\, IN\, 47429
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblesouthcentralindiana/event/980378/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible South Central Indiana (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
